id: SAFE23-2
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: transition_limit
target: crates/core/src/transit.rs
find:     state.run.current = None; // 止めた後
replace:     let _ = &state.run.current; // 止めた後
expect-fail: cycle_enter_self_stops_at_limit
expect-fail: cycle_enter_2_stops_at_limit
expect-fail: cycle_exit_2_stops_at_limit
note: 止めたときに現在の Step を空にしない（以降の入力が巡回の途中の Step に届く）
